></name><name><surname>Marathe</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Construction of the model for the Genetic Analysis Workshop 14 simulated data: genotype-phenotype relationships, gene interaction, linkage, association, disequilibrium, and ascertainment effects for a complex phenotype</article-title><source>BMC Genet</source><year>2005</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>S3</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16451639</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2156-6-S1-S3</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>